--TEST--
a key of a `Core` attribute names a field declared outside the workspace, so renaming it is refused, as renaming the attribute is, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Blog
{
    #[Core\Route(pa<|>th: "/", method: Core\Http\Method::Get)]
    public static function index(): string
    {
        return "hello";
    }
}
--REQUEST--
rename to=url
--EXPECT--
refused: `Core\Route::path` is declared outside this workspace, so it cannot be renamed.
